\subsection{Evaluation Subjects and Bias Mitigation}

To ensure balanced validation, mitigate individual biases, and capture a wide range of perspectives, the evaluation process is carried out independently by \textbf{four differentiated evaluators}:

\begin{itemize}
	\item \textbf{Human Evaluators (2):}
	      \begin{itemize}
		      \item \textit{Expert Evaluator:} PhD in Biology.
		      \item \textit{Control Evaluator:} Non-specialist profile.
	      \end{itemize}
	\item \textbf{LLM-as-a-judge (2):}
	      \begin{itemize}
		      \item \textit{Proprietary Model (Gemini)}: Gemini3.1 Flash Lite
		      \item \textit{Open Source Model (Qwen)}: Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-Instruct
	      \end{itemize}
\end{itemize}

